---
title: Greetings from the Crustaceans
permalink: /index.html
---
{% extends "_includes/layouts/base.njk" %}

{% block extraCSS %}
<style>
  /* ====== Homepage-specific: front-card gradient backgrounds ====== */
  .front-which     { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6ba9bd, #3c7389 50%, #274455); }
  .front-routes    { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #efbf77, #d28a40 50%, #92522a); }
  .front-tuning    { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d78872, #b15d51 50%, #743934); }
  .front-community { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8ab79b, #5e9274 50%, #345945); }
  .front-clawwatch { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7ec8d6, #3e8e9f 50%, #225a6e); }
  .front-nemoclaw  { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e06830, #a84418 50%, #6e2a0e); }

  /* ====== Horizontal scroll strip (postcard rack) ====== */
  .postcard-grid {
    display: flex; gap: 1rem; overflow-x: auto; scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    scrollbar-width: thin;
  }
  .postcard-grid::-webkit-scrollbar { height: 6px; }
  .postcard-grid::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border-radius: 3px; }
  .postcard-grid::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); border-radius: 3px; }
  .postcard-grid > .postcard-card {
    flex: 0 0 min(320px, 70vw); scroll-snap-align: start; min-height: 380px;
  }

  /* ====== Summary band (homepage only) ====== */
  .summary-band {
    margin: 1.1rem 0 0; padding: 1rem 1.1rem; border-radius: 16px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(244, 201, 107, 0.16), rgba(93, 143, 163, 0.08));
    border: 1px solid rgba(216, 121, 89, 0.12);
  }
  html.dark .summary-band {
    background: rgba(93,143,163,0.1);
    border-color: rgba(93,143,163,0.2);
    color: #e8ebe8;
  }
  html.dark .summary-band strong { color: #e8ebe8; }
  html.dark .summary-band a { color: #8ab4c7; }
  html.dark .summary-band a:hover { color: #d87959; }

  /* ====== Front illustration (homepage) ====== */
  .front-illustration {
    position: relative; z-index: 2; margin-top: 1rem;
    border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    min-height: 150px; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center;
  }
  .art-jaunty svg { width: 74%; transform: rotate(-6deg) translateY(10px); transform-origin: center bottom; }
</style>
{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
<div class="hero">
  <div>
    <span class="eyebrow">The Crustaceans Postcard Rack</span>
    <h1>Greetings from the Crustaceans</h1>
    <p class="lede">A rack of seaside dispatches for the OpenClaw coast. Pick a card, read the postcard, and see what the tide brings up next.</p>
  </div>
  <aside class="note-card">
    <h3>What's this about?</h3>
    <p>crustaceans.sh is a postcard-themed wayfinding guide to the self-hosted AI assistant ecosystem — OpenClaw, NanoClaw, PicoClaw, NemoClaw, and everything in between.</p>
  </aside>
</div>

<div class="summary-band">
  <strong>Consensus in one breath:</strong> if you're new to this coast, start with <a href="/first-routes/">First Setup Routes</a>, read <a href="/which-claw/">Which Claw?</a> for the lay of the land, then browse the rest when you're ready to dip your toes in.
</div>

